  "notes": "{炒|いた}める is an ichidan verb meaning to stir-fry or sauté.\n\nHOMOPHONE WARNING:\n- {炒|いた}める: to stir-fry (cooking)\n- {傷|いた}める: to damage, hurt\nDistinguished by kanji; context usually makes meaning clear.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {野菜|やさい}を{炒|いた}める: to stir-fry vegetables\n- {肉|にく}を{炒|いた}める: to stir-fry meat\n- {強火|つよび}で{炒|いた}める: to stir-fry over high heat\n- {油|あぶら}で{炒|いた}める: to fry in oil\n\nCOOKING VOCABULARY:\n- {炒|いた}め{物|もの}: stir-fried dish\n- {野菜|やさい}{炒|いた}め: vegetable stir-fry\n- チャーハン/{炒飯|チャーハン}: fried rice\n\nOTHER COOKING VERBS:\n- {焼|や}く: to grill/bake\n- {煮|に}る: to simmer/boil\n- {揚|あ}げる: to deep-fry\n- {蒸|む}す: to steam",
